      "Beauty?",
      "",
      "One morning, after Little Yu got out of bed, she saw a WeChat message that Ben had sent her:",
      "Call on you at 9 o’clock, beauty.",
      "Little Yu was very happy, because she likes Ben a lot.",
      "",
      "This day, Little Yu didn’t go anywhere. She waited from morning to afternoon, but Ben never came.",
      "",
      "Little Yu was very angry and called Ben, “Why didn’t you call on me?”",
      "",
      "Ben said. “I called on you yesterday evening at 9 o’clock, but there was no one at your house!”",
      "",
      "Little Yu looked at the WeChat message one more time. It turned out that Ben had written “no one” as “beauty”.",
